196
00:08:43,914 --> 00:08:46,963
Oh, I love Allison Scott.
She's a spark plug, isn't she?

197
00:08:47,058 --> 00:08:48,951
Yeah, she is. So anyway--

198
00:08:49,054 --> 00:08:50,639
