for the hungry shut-ins.

207
00:09:21,174 --> 00:09:22,809
I'm racking up
double hours here. I mean...

208
00:09:22,904 --> 00:09:25,206
Hey, tito!
Keep your head in the game.

209
00:09:25,292 --> 00:09:26,626
